{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39750","headline":"奉和翁文尧员外经过七林书堂见寄之什 · 黄滔","name":"奉和翁文尧员外经过七林书堂见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱旗引入昔茆堂，半日从容尽日忙。\n驷马宝车行锡礼，金章紫绶带天香。\n山从南国添烟翠，龙起东溟认夜光。\n定恐故园留不住，竹风松韵漫凄锵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}